  "_doc": "Outer Layer (skin), 'skin warmth, slide light': F major at 64.2857 BPM (a beat is 28 frames, a 16th exactly 7 frames at 30 fps). A soft, low-passed pad in a small warm room and sparse nylon plucks (Karplus-Strong 'pluck', new for this channel) on the off-beats; a sub only for the whoa. Foley is soft and tonal: plucks for labels, a low felt knock for layers, plops for water. No bells (Lumevina), no fizz (Lumevina's dew), no ping (Light Minute), no mallet (Meanwhile, Inside), no blip (Rest Frame). Signature: plucks F5, C6, A5, 7 frames apart (root, fifth, then the third settling under it: an answer). It plays on the title, at the end of counters and on the end card.",
